<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N70/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N70/>;
    dc:modified '2008-04-15T14:00:00'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'sea_surface_swell_wave_mean_period_from_variance_spectral_density_first_frequency_moment'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The swell wave directional spectrum can be written as a  five dimensional function S(t,x,y,f,theta) where t is time, x and y are horizontal coordinates (such as longitude and latitude), f is frequency and theta is direction.  S can be integrated over direction to give S1= integral(S dtheta).  Frequency moments, M(n) of S1 can then be calculated as follows: M(n) = integral(S1 f^n df), where f^n is f to the power of n.  The first wave period, T(m1), is calculated as the ratio M(0)/M(1).'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P07::CFV8N70'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N71/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N71/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N71/>;
    dc:modified '2008-04-15T14:00:00'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'sea_surface_swell_wave_mean_period_from_variance_spectral_density_inverse_frequency_moment'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The swell wave directional spectrum can be written as a  five dimensional function S(t,x,y,f,theta) where t is time, x and y are horizontal coordinates (such as longitude and latitude), f is frequency and theta is direction.  S can be integrated over direction to give  S1= integral(S dtheta).  Frequency moments, M(n) of S1 can then be calculated as follows: M(n) = integral(S1 f^n df), where f^n is f to the power of n.  The inverse wave period, T(m-1), is calculated as the ratio M(-1)/M(0).'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P07::CFV8N71'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N72/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N72/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N72/>;
    dc:modified '2008-04-15T14:00:00'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'sea_surface_swell_wave_mean_period_from_variance_spectral_density_second_frequency_moment'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The swell wave directional spectrum can be written as a  five dimensional function S(t,x,y,f,theta) where t is time, x and y are horizontal coordinates (such as longitude and latitude), f is frequency and theta is direction.  S can be integrated over direction to give S1= integral(S dtheta).  Frequency moments, M(n) of S1 can then be calculated as follows: M(n) = integral(S1 f^n df), where f^n is f to the power of n.  The second wave period, T(m2), is calculated as the square root of the ratio M(0)/M(2).'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P07::CFV8N72'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N73/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N73/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N73/>;
    dc:modified '2008-04-15T14:00:00'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'sea_surface_wave_mean_period_from_variance_spectral_density_first_frequency_moment'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The wave directional spectrum can be written as a  five dimensional function S(t,x,y,f,theta) where t is time, x and y are horizontal coordinates (such as longitude and latitude), f is frequency and theta is direction.  S has the standard name sea_surface_wave_directional_variance_spectral_density.  S can be integrated over direction to give S1= integral(S dtheta) and this quantity has the standard name sea_surface_wave_variance_spectral_density.  Frequency moments, M(n) of S1 can then be calculated as follows: M(n) = integral(S1 f^n df), where f^n is f to the power of n.  The first wave period, T(m1)  is calculated as the ratio M(0)/M(1).'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P07::CFV8N73'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N74/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV8N74/1/>
